{"screen_name": "isapeed", "file": "isapeed", "name": "いさり", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1377345310926594048/y6hSdFVi.jpg", "header_url": null, "description": "春宵は短すぎる。", "acceptable": false, "missing": false, "total_works": 4, "scraped_works": 4, "first_seen": "2026-02-20T00:19:35.610669+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-23T14:26:25.218553+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 23000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-20T00:19:35.610669+00:00"}, {"amount": 18000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-20T11:14:12.509420+00:00"}, {"amount": 16000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-20T18:18:04.539979+00:00"}, {"amount": 33000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-21T02:46:27.568113+00:00"}, {"amount": 14000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-22T06:15:38.140289+00:00"}, {"amount": 13000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-22T15:53:43.717326+00:00"}, {"amount": 33000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-23T08:05:37.819874+00:00"}, {"amount": 25000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-23T14:26:25.218553+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 25000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 13000, "max": 33000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/isapeed", "name": "isapeed"}], "flags": {}, "works": [{"path": "/@isapeed/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e393fa65/uploads/origins/34fddfa7-c6f1-4a06-b9a0-d838e017a660?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06e84991afc6759ba9ebc1b47b16233e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e393fa65/uploads/origins/34fddfa7-c6f1-4a06-b9a0-d838e017a660?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06e84991afc6759ba9ebc1b47b16233e, https://si.imgix.net/e393fa65/uploads/origins/34fddfa7-c6f1-4a06-b9a0-d838e017a660?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e439bf420c58e92a3b2677fd875920be 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e393fa65/uploads/origins/34fddfa7-c6f1-4a06-b9a0-d838e017a660?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d8bc1341043f845cdfe0df1703472d6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "想要有關藍綠色蝴蝶的感覺，暗色之中帶著點綴的麟分——。整體就是一看有骷髏以及華麗又性感成熟的歌德風，看得出來有智慧以及賢者的模樣，縱然本質是怪盜，但顏色可以在黑暗之中有五彩斑斕的咒語或是魔藥、魔法陣也可以展現歌德風的神秘感和當代的煉金術先進、花的部分則是想選貼近的乾燥花，亦或是變出的鮮花、想要藍柑橘就像是就像roselia的紗夜所代表的顏色和感覺，氣質部分其實是小惡魔……雖然對人友善但還是有小惡魔的一面，希望裙擺是長的就像婚紗一樣，日常也可以但結婚也可以的服飾！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@isapeed/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e9ba3549/uploads/origins/a72bd784-dcc9-45d0-ab04-ba0eaa8e7756?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ee61b3f10a3500ac46f988f1be8d73a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e9ba3549/uploads/origins/a72bd784-dcc9-45d0-ab04-ba0eaa8e7756?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ee61b3f10a3500ac46f988f1be8d73a, https://si.imgix.net/e9ba3549/uploads/origins/a72bd784-dcc9-45d0-ab04-ba0eaa8e7756?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3d32b4de0f750983bfa5bff1e0e2d8b2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e9ba3549/uploads/origins/a72bd784-dcc9-45d0-ab04-ba0eaa8e7756?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbfc8cef35ef3c60e46ff4f6261f342d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "我想要藍柑橘和奧伯隆一樣的風格，和洋折衷並且主體為昆蟲，搭配奧伯隆那樣的藍色衣服基調的另一套衣服。也有個藍色玫瑰的緞帶小禮帽！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@isapeed/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2b2513eb/uploads/origins/bf36ca4f-45e4-46f6-9590-537be4b0cda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c9c8cc97b57b3ffcb5a6824a26bfb3d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2b2513eb/uploads/origins/bf36ca4f-45e4-46f6-9590-537be4b0cda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c9c8cc97b57b3ffcb5a6824a26bfb3d, https://si.imgix.net/2b2513eb/uploads/origins/bf36ca4f-45e4-46f6-9590-537be4b0cda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90f56f9ee12014fb3df6001d05d6bab1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2b2513eb/uploads/origins/bf36ca4f-45e4-46f6-9590-537be4b0cda7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d08392e415318b94b3f624a3b5cee5dd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "請畫一個白色奧伯隆的服設，主題是和洋折衷但融合英式皇家的整體風格以及手上拿著大正咖啡食物的樣子，（他偏好綠色哈密瓜也可以加入其他水果！）。衣服也加上各種蝴蝶翅膀的元素還有古董蟲子的復古別針，令他看起來就像個小王子一樣並且衣服也融合就像他王冠的菱形王冠元素，鞋子是男性英式的高跟鞋，希望有高叉和式看到半邊美腿，會令人想要摸一下的那種，領口可以稍微看得到胸部線條，希望衣服貼身一點，有下擺半透明布料。希望他有小禮帽，上面有飛燕草和薔薇以及緞帶的搭配，適合陰柔外表的他。希望他身邊也有藍柑咪！整體主色調為藍色系。如果可以的話想加入一些巫師元素，但如果太突兀就算了。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@isapeed/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3fd5e471/uploads/origins/4805f3fc-314b-4ed9-b05d-9c3149beec34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5689cc2b2549e85d4dbd44645c426cbf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3fd5e471/uploads/origins/4805f3fc-314b-4ed9-b05d-9c3149beec34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5689cc2b2549e85d4dbd44645c426cbf, https://si.imgix.net/3fd5e471/uploads/origins/4805f3fc-314b-4ed9-b05d-9c3149beec34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dd761071e1315861a077712685fd0267 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3fd5e471/uploads/origins/4805f3fc-314b-4ed9-b05d-9c3149beec34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=07037a6d8c8b9b950698f80f2fc3e64f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "想要雙人藍綠色海洋立繪！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}